# VuePresyo auth

Login only. There is no registration screen and no client call to create a user.

- Accounts are created by `backend/VuePresyo.Api/Data/DbSeeder.cs` on API startup.
- Seeded members: Aidee (`abdinglasa@gmail.com`) and Jeff (`jeffrey.t.go@gmail.com`). Both belong to group `GO`.
- After login, the header chip reads the authenticated user (`name`, `groupId`) and must show `Group GO · {name}`.
- Backend endpoints require a valid JWT Bearer token with `groupId == "GO"`.
- Receipt, item, product, store, and price-history **writes** go through `/api/functions/saveReceipt` (`VuePresyoService.SaveReceiptAsync`).
- Do not store the buyer name, address, or TIN from a receipt.

